op-melt-past = melted completely
op-melt-past-molten = melted completely
op-pass-current-past = was under current for
op-heat-to-past = heated up to
op-freeze-past = froze completely
op-freeze-past-molten = set completely
op-boil-past = boiled
op-cool-to-past = cooled down to
op-settle-past = came to thermal equilibrium
op-evaporate-past = boiled dry
